@host = http://localhost:5000

# @name createCover
POST {{host}}/covers?includeBounds=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geometry": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [
      [
        [105.8, 21.0],
        [105.9, 21.0],
        [105.9, 21.1],
        [105.8, 21.1],
        [105.8, 21.0]
      ]
    ]
  },
  "zoom": 12
}

### Reuse coverId from the createCover response.

GET {{host}}/covers/{{createCover.response.body.$.coverId}}/tiles?zoom=14&includeBounds=true
